{% comment %}
Follow and support emblems. This is rendered twice on comic pages:
- `placement: "side"` (in comic.liquid) puts them on either side of the comic
  page on wide screens: follow links on the left, support links on the right.
- `placement: "row"` (after the author notes) shows them as a row between the
  notes and the comments on narrower screens and for double-page spreads.
Only one of the two is visible at a time; see "comic side emblems" in style.css.
The email sign-up (subscribe.liquid) rides along: under the follow links on the
side, or at the end of the row.
{% endcomment %}
<div class="comic-socials comic-socials--{{ placement | default: "row" }}{% if spread %} comic-socials--spread{% endif %}">
  <div class="comic-socials-group comic-socials-left">
    <a class="comic-social comic-social-bluesky" href="https://bsky.app/profile/forscher22.bsky.social" target="_blank" rel="noopener me" aria-label="Bluesky" title="Bluesky">
